▶️ Step 1: Start the FastAPI server

```
poetry run tiny api
```

Server will start at:
`(http://127.0.0.1:8001)`

▶️ Step 2: Create request JSON file

Create a file named request.json in the project root:

```json
{
  "url": "https://example.com"
}
```

▶️ Step 3: Send request using curl (Windows PowerShell)

```
curl.exe -X POST "http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/shorten" `
  -H "accept: application/json" `
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" `
  --data-binary "@request.json"
```

▶️ Step 4: Expected Response

```json
{
  "short_url": "http://127.0.0.1:8001/abc123",
  "original_url": "https://example.com"
}
```
